      "writtenOn": "2026-09-12T17:05:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this case would returning None cause us to upload the image again rather than logically copy it? If the projects are the same then we can probably just noop rather than do a proper upload? Maybe this case is handled elsewhere.",
      "revId": "c13122a6effdb14c51b252a98167d5d6495db01c",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ad247e36_f830078f",
